        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: East Knoyle, Wiltshire, England\n- People: Sir Christopher Wren\n- Buildings: Clouds House\n- Concepts: civil parish, English architecture, listed buildings\n\nFacts:\n- East Knoyle is a village and civil parish in Wiltshire in the south west of England.\n- Sir Christopher Wren was born on 30 October 1632 and died on 8 March 1723.\n- East Knoyle is the birthplace of Sir Christopher Wren.\n- Sir Christopher Wren was one of the most highly acclaimed English architects in history.\n- Clouds House, also known simply as Clouds, is a Grade II* listed building at East Knoyle in Wiltshire, England.",
